FFmpeg master 5e8f97c467ca (2026-10-02), not in release/9.0 after 9.0.2:
https://github.com/FFmpeg/FFmpeg/commit/5e8f97c467ca203ff01b34db7cee0e3496f4e99b

mov: mov_read_trun() zeroed only the newly allocated part of tts_data, the
entries between tts_count and the index entries kept uninitialised memory,
which became timestamps of samples.

--- a/libavformat/mov.c
